call Chars.ActSound $char $act 35 mecanismo-police1 0.03 +4
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 42 mecanismo-police2 0.03
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 50 Police-pasoA 0.035
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 58 Police-pasoB 0.035
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 70 mecanismo-police1 0.01
let act DazedInit
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 10 mecanismo-police2 0.03
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 20 mecanismo-police1 0.03 +5
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 30 mecanismo-police2 0.03 +5
